in darkness.</i>

5
00:01:29.256 --> 00:01:32.157
<i>I know it had a happy ending
of some sort but...</i>

6
00:01:32.159 --> 00:01:34.193
<i>all I can remember
is the way it made me feel.</i>

7
00:01:36.263 --> 00:01:39.303
<i>Seemed like it could just</i>
<i>swallow you up, the way</i>
<i>she told it,</i>

8
